1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,656
But P680 has now lost an electron, and it becomes the strongest oxidising agent in biology.

2
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:09,934
It pulls electrons out of water.

3
00:00:09,934 --> 00:00:19,062
This is photolysis: two water give one oxygen, four protons and four electrons, at a manganese cluster on the lumen side.

4
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:21,914
So the protons stay in the lumen.

